# C# build leftovers. Matched anywhere rather than per-project: app/windows
# was added later, its 149 MB publish output went straight into a commit, and
# GitHub refused the push. A rule that has to be extended for every new project
# is a rule that will be forgotten again.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/out/
release.noindex/

# Screenshots taken while debugging. Two of these reached the public repo by
